{
  "slug": "the-pragmatic-pm-toolkit",
  "name": "The Pragmatic Pm Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Pragmatic PM is a Claude Code plugin with 43 PM skills, 5 orchestrator agents, and 4 multi-stage workflows designed for product leadership. It covers the full PM lifecycle: discovery (JTBD, personas), strategy (OKRs, quarterly planning, SWOT), execution (PRDs in 4 modes, pricing with Monetizing Innovation methodology, AI feature pricing), communication (SCQA executive updates, decision docs, board decks), go-to-market (Dunford positioning, competitive battlecards, objection handling, sales decks), and operations (retros, post-mortems, CS playbooks). Every skill enforces problem clarity before solutions, leading and lagging metrics, and explicit non-goals. Domain-agnostic — customize a single file for your company and every skill adapts. Personal-context.md tailors depth to your seniority.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **54 skills**, **5 agents** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (54): `pm-ab-test` (Design rigorous A/B tests with hypothesis formulation, sample size calculation, success criteria, guardrail metrics, and rollout planning), `pm-ai-pricing` (AI pricing strategy for SaaS products), `pm-battlecard` (Per-competitor sales battlecard — a 1-page scannable cheat sheet a rep pulls up mid-call), `pm-board-deck` (Generate content for board or investor deck presentations), `pm-build-vs-buy` (Build/buy/partner decision framework with scoring across time-to-value, TCO, strategic control, and integration complexity), `pm-cohort-planner` (Cohort migration-readiness discovery), `pm-customer-success` (Customer success playbook generator for lifecycle stages: onboarding, adoption, expansion, renewal, churn prevention), `pm-dashboard-designer` (Analytics dashboard design tool), and 46 more\n- **Agents** (5): `pm-comms-writer` (PM communication orchestrator), `pm-data-analyst` (Data analysis orchestrator agent), `pm-discovery-lead` (Discovery orchestrator agent), `pm-gtm-strategist` (Go-to-market orchestrator agent), `pm-ops-facilitator` (PM operations orchestrator)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `PostToolUse`, `PostToolUseFailure`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install the-pragmatic-pm-toolkit@claude-community` from `marfoerst/the-pragmatic-pm`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
